agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/acceptance/release/runs/A4-post-cursor-topic-20260831/logs/A4-archive-boundary.log-407-2288-- Remote context blow-up came from durable continuity replaying full tool/reasoning histories over HTTP: sessions reached `358k-370k` input tokens against a reported `258400` window and Sub2API returned `No tool output found for custom tool call ...` as 502. The repair required account WSv2 `ctx_pool`, Redis scheduler-cache clear/restart, and `[model_providers.sub2api] supports_websockets = true`; fresh Codex processes then showed `openai_ws_mode=true`, `request_type=3`, and bounded multi-tool inputs. Existing processes do not hot-reload this setting [Task 1]
