     6	  "root_cause": "The persisted disposition_evidence held only a one-way input fingerprint and mutable result-linked fields. Because the input fingerprint digest was not a durable canonical projection of the complete input identity, an attacker could replace input A's observation, idempotency key, content digest, risk flags, and result evidence with values from persisted input B, recompute local digests, or introduce a valid manual queue item and make an ordinary input appear to be high-risk manual review. The loader had no independently persisted projection against which to reconstruct the TopicObservationInput identity and disposition.",
